From 31ecedca986c6fd49a1d87b1239fcfe5f116e02a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:44:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(l3): authenticated VM display proxy tunnel

Add a custom Node server (server.ts) wrapping the Next standalone handler and
intercepting the WebSocket upgrade on /api/runtime/vm/display/ws. A new
display proxy (lib/vm/display-proxy.ts) authenticates via session cookie,
checks Origin, resolves the upstream websockify endpoint only through the VM
manager's desktopEndpoint(userId) (ensure() first), and pipes frames both ways.
GET /api/runtime/vm/display reports availability. Custom close codes: 4401
not signed in, 4404 no display (fake driver), 4503 VM failed to start. Max 3
viewers per user, 30 min idle reap, connect/disconnect audit entries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
